                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Conger</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-01-26"><hi rendition="#italic">January 26,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay approves Mr. Conger’s attitude on both points as reported in his
